        "heading_H8wbHU": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Our Humble Beginnings</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_V48QWy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Channel International Enterprises <strong>began in 2009</strong> as a small 40 sqm shop along Jacinto Quezon Avenue in Quezon City. What started with just four passionate individuals has grown into a full-scale multimedia powerhouse, now housed in a 250 sqm facility at #43 Don Alejandro Roces Avenue.<br/></p><p>Over the years, we’ve built the Philippines’ first specialized online store for multimedia gear — <strong>channel.com.ph</strong> — offering more than <strong>10,000 products</strong>, representing <strong>100+ brands</strong>, and covering <strong>250+ categories</strong>, from pro audio and broadcast to lighting, CCTV, and tools.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
