    "image_with_text_yX7fyb": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_ceyDrG": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>What Drives Us</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_6xkTpp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our name — Channel — is more than just a brand. It’s our mission: to serve as a conduit for technology, connecting people and institutions with the tools they need to create, communicate, and worship. We believe in making these solutions accessible, reliable, and meaningful.<br/></p><p>From the start, we set out not just to sell gear, but to bless those who work with us — whether it's a church building a worship system, a school building a media lab, or a broadcaster setting up a studio. We aim to be a true <strong>Channel of Blessing.</strong></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
